     "problem_md": "Strategies are required to limit population increase. One strategy is to improve the availability of contraception.\n\nDescribe the benefits and limitations of this strategy for managing population change.",
     "solution_md": "> **[mark-scheme]**\n> any four from: \n> max 3 from benefits: \n> reduces unwanted pregnancies;\n> \n> allows couples to plan families; \n> allows women to work / stay in education;\n> \n> promotes safe sex / reduces spread of STIs / STDs / HIV / named sexually transmitted disease (use of barrier method of contraception);\n> \n> max 3 from limitations: \n> may challenge (religious) beliefs; \n> may not be socially / culturally / gender acceptable in some communities; \n> encourages more casual sex; \n> availability of contraception would need to be alongside;\n> education/family planning to be successful; \n> lack of access / distribution issues in remote areas;"
